      "정한 값에 산다": "Buy at the agreed price",
      "이미 많이 깎아 주었네. 더는 안 되지만, 먼저 정한 값은 지키지.": "I've already knocked plenty off. No more, but I'll keep the price we agreed.",
      "추가 협상은 거절당했다 · 먼저 깎은 가격은 유지": "The extra negotiation was refused · the earlier discount stands",
