      "<span class=\"muted\">거래 중단</span>": "<span class=\"muted\">Trade suspended</span>",
      "<span class=\"tag era-up\" title=\"산지의 전란·교역 독점으로 공급이 줄어 매입가가 높고 재고가 적다. 중계항도 영향을 받는다.\">공급 부족</span>": "<span class=\"tag era-up\" title=\"War or a trade monopoly at the source has cut supply, so buy prices are high and stock is low. Entrepôts are affected too.\">Short supply</span>",
      "<span class=\"tag era-down\" title=\"수출 생산이 늘어 매입가가 내리고 재고가 넉넉해졌다.\">생산 확대</span>": "<span class=\"tag era-down\" title=\"Export production has grown, so buy prices are lower and stock is plentiful.\">Expanded output</span>",
      "<span class=\"tag spec\" title=\"이 고장에서 나는 물건이라 싸고 재고가 넉넉하다. 어디서나 흔한 물건이라 멀리 가져가도 크게 남지는 않는다.\">특산</span>": "<span class=\"tag spec\" title=\"Produced in these parts, so it's cheap and plentiful. It's common everywhere, so hauling it far won't earn much.\">Local product</span>",
      "<span class=\"tag cheap\" title=\"이 물건이 나는 고장이라 흔하다 — 팔아도 헐값이고, 조금만 팔아도 값이 곤두박질친다.\">산지</span>": "<span class=\"tag cheap\" title=\"This is where it's produced, so it's common — it sells for a pittance, and the price plunges after selling just a little.\">Source</span>",
      "<span class=\"up\" title=\"이미 받아 줄 양을 넘었다 — 팔수록 값이 무너진다\">넘침</span>": "<span class=\"up\" title=\"Already past what the market will take — the more you sell, the further the price collapses\">Glutted</span>",
      "<span class=\"tag\" title=\"유행하는 물건 — 값이 뛰었다\">유행</span>": "<span class=\"tag\" title=\"In fashion — the price has jumped\">Trending</span>",
      "「중계」는 이 항구가 먼 산지에서 들여온 물건이라 산지보다 비쌉니다.": "\"Relay\" goods are brought into this port from distant sources, so they cost more than at the source.",
