      ". 짐은 빠른 배부터 싣고, 선장의 항해술 1마다 그 배가 3.5% 빨라집니다 (선장이 없으면 −4%).": ". Cargo is loaded on the fastest ships first, and each point of the captain's navigation makes that ship 3.5% faster (−4% with no captain).",
